WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.460
If the forceful coughing fails to clear the airway

00:00:02.460 --> 00:00:06.660
during mild choking, the situation becomes severe choking.

00:00:06.660 --> 00:00:08.480
This is a life and death emergency

00:00:08.480 --> 00:00:10.480
where the airway is completely blocked.

00:00:10.480 --> 00:00:13.860
In this state, the victim is unable to make any sound at all.

00:00:13.860 --> 00:00:16.940
They cannot speak, breathe, or cough.

00:00:16.940 --> 00:00:19.180
You will often see them clutching their throat

00:00:19.180 --> 00:00:21.459
in the universal sign for choking,

00:00:21.459 --> 00:00:24.620
and their skin may begin turning pale or blue

00:00:24.620 --> 00:00:26.540
as they lose oxygen.

00:00:26.620 --> 00:00:28.940
Left untreated, this leads quickly

00:00:28.940 --> 00:00:31.180
to unconsciousness and death.

00:00:31.180 --> 00:00:32.740
If you recognize these signs,

00:00:32.740 --> 00:00:36.020
you must shout for help and call 911 immediately.

